            "review_title": "Review at RuNam Bistro",
            "review_text": "Richard_ATB\nLeicester, United Kingdom201 contributions\n0\nGood bu pricey\nAug 2019\nVisited Runam Bistro as a family of four for evening dinner on our first night in Hanoi. Seems to be a chain across Hanoi and HCM City. Located close to the Opera House and overall was very good. Interior decor pleasant.\n\nFood tasty; service efficient; price on the expensive side for Hanoi and menu prices did not include tax, so an unexpected 10% was added to the bill, plus another unknown amount, but wasn’t worth disputing. \n\nGood, but the choice in Hanoi is big.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 23, 2019",
